OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'exceptionally
OL,4,Atalented' 16-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to an
OL,7,F"exceptionally talented" schoolgirl who
OL,8,Fthe BBC understands died in a tourist
OL,9,Fboat accident in the Dominican
OL,10,FRepublic.
OL,12,FAccording to a fundraising page set up
OL,13,Fto support her family, Abbie Lainton,
OL,14,F16, from Swindon, Wiltshire, died on 30
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FMillie Fannin, director of Swindon
OL,18,FLightning Cheerleading Club where Abbie
OL,19,Fattended and coached also said the
OL,20,Fteenager was "effortlessly beautiful"
OL,21,Fand "made the world a more beautiful
OL,22,Fplace when she was in it".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
