OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'exceptionally
OL,4,Atalented' 16-year-old
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Foreign, Commonwealth and
OL,7,FDevelopment Office (FCDO) said its
OL,8,Fthoughts were with the family. Both the
OL,9,FFCDO and the BBC has made contact with
OL,10,Fthe local authorities in the Dominican
OL,11,FRepublic.
